[[1,1,0,"<h2>BELT-DRIVEN TIMING SYSTEM</h2><h3>Specifications</h3><h3>Type</h3><p>Direct drive, via toothed belt that drives the coolant pump in addition to the camshafts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/34021.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>1 - Drive pulley.</li><li>2 - Fixed tensioner.</li><li>3 - Exhaust side driven pulley.</li><li>4 - Intake side driven pulley.</li><li>5 - Coolant pump.</li><li>6 - Mobile tensioner.</li></ul></figure>"]]